    (3.4, 2.9) .. (5.1, 3.1).. controls (6.5, 3.3) and (7.0, 3.4) .. (6.0, 4.2) -- (6.0, 4.2).. controls (6.7, 4.2) and
    (7.4, 4.6) .. (8.1, 4.0).. controls (8.0, 3.3) and (8.0, 2.7) ..  (7.9, 2.1).. controls (5.0, 2.3) and
